 "changelog": [
  "**Accessibility Principles** (`tc-accessibility-principles`, `AccessibilityPrinciples`): the four kinds of need accessibility serves – visual, hearing, motor and cognitive – above the four principles that serve them, with a connector from each principle to its needs. Drawn like the other illustrations, in a 4 : 3 frame so the words fit; the words come from `labels`, and its name is a sentence saying which principle serves which need."
 ],
